  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats are made with high-density TPE material, using advanced 3D laser technology, which not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear resistance but also offers a precise fit to your vehicle floor.\nFitment\n2025 2026 Toyota Camry (Include Hybrid)\nOnly fit carpet flooring.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These floor mats are compatible with 2025 2026 Toyota Camry (Include Hybrid), not for vehicles with vinyl floors. 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back\nEco-Safe Certification: Our TPE Camry floor mats 2025 2026 are recyclable and durable, with approval by GRS ,SGS, IATF; Eco-safe material easily withstands the rigor of daily abuse for long-lasting performance in both arctic cold and tropical heat\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: The unique designed channels and raised edge can effectively trap liquids, snow, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean. Even in wet conditions, the hooks can effectively prevent the 2025 2026 Camry car mats from slipping. The mats are available for children and the elderly\nEasy To Clean: The textured skid-resistant surface is easily cleaned. Neither cumbersome vacuum cleaners nor harsh chemicals are needed; simply shake them out or spray them down with a hose, Please remove old floor mats before installing new floor liners\nWhy Choose Yitamotor: Our floor mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle",
